    {
      "kind": "prose",
      "tokens": [
        {
          "t": "strong",
          "v": "Why this order."
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " Each task makes what the next one needs. Defaults belong to an item group, so the groups come first. A new item takes its data from the defaults, so the defaults come before the items. A BOM and a routing belong to an item, so the items come before them. The made item's standard cost adds up its BOM and routing, so the costing rows come after those."
        }
      ],
